TO CREDITORS AND OTHER PARTIES IN INTEREST:
PLEASE TAKE NOTICE that a receiver was appointed for , whose last known addressis , on , .
YOU ARE HEREBY FURTHER NOTIFIED that in order to receive any dividend in this proceeding youmust file proof of claim with the court within 30 days after the date of this notice. If you are a state agency,you must file proof of claim with the receiver ((on or before , 120)) within 180 days ((from))after the date of ((appointment of the receiver)) this notice. A copy of your claim must also be either mailedto or served upon the receiver.
